sequenceDiagram

participant Patient
participant Package
participant Runtime
participant Metadata

Package->>Runtime: Assign Care Plan v1

Runtime->>Runtime: Create Snapshot

Metadata->>Metadata: Publish Metadata v2

Metadata-->>Package: Metadata Change Event

Package->>Package: Future Assignments Use v2

Patient->>Runtime: Continue Existing Care Plan

Runtime->>Runtime: Uses Snapshot v1

Note over Runtime: No automatic migration\nNo automatic metadata refresh\nNo automatic care plan update